WEBVTT

00:12:27.070 --> 00:12:31.096
Loneliness is a big problem
in the UK, even pre-Brexit.

00:12:31.120 --> 00:12:34.296
In one survey, up to a fifth
of all UK adults felt lonely

00:12:34.320 --> 00:12:36.196
most or all of the time.

00:12:36.220 --> 00:12:39.186
So in 2018, Parliament
created an official program

00:12:39.210 --> 00:12:42.576
to help check in on people
who lacked strong social ties.

00:12:42.600 --> 00:12:44.401
And a number of big British companies

00:12:44.425 --> 00:12:47.206
signed a pledge to improve
employees' connections.

00:12:47.230 --> 00:12:49.516
I chatted with Baroness
Barran for a few minutes

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:51.423
during the recent Brexit negotiations.

00:12:51.447 --> 00:12:53.506
And she told me that
she herself felt lonely

00:12:53.530 --> 00:12:55.520
when she began her tenure in Parliament.

00:12:55.544 --> 00:12:58.655
DB: You feel like you've arrived
at this enormous school,

00:12:58.679 --> 00:13:01.033
where everyone else has 600 best friends,